================================================================================
Derived data
================================================================================

The test fixtures

    tests/fixtures/batf/
    tests/fixtures/batf_1d99721/

are derived from the example data distributed with `methylTFR` in
`inst/extdata`, at the pinned commit and at commit `1d99721` respectively. They
are converted from the upstream `GRanges` / `Rle` `.rda` objects into the
plain tab-separated formats described in `docs/AGENT_PLAN.md` section 3, with no
change to the underlying coordinates, scores, coverage values or GC bins.

The fixtures

    tests/fixtures/parsers/

are copies of the methylation input examples distributed with `methylTFR` in
`inst/extdata` (`*.tsv.gz`).

These derived data files remain covered by the upstream MIT licence,
Copyright (c) 2025 Epigenome Informatics.
